                [ 'h3', 'xTool F2: a compact laser for personalisation' ],
                [ 'p', 'The portable F2 combines a 15 W diode laser with a 5 W infrared one, has a 50 MP camera with manually refreshed preview and works at up to 6,000 mm/s. It is a compact machine with a small working area, though, not meant for large sheets. The F2 is a Class 4 professional laser: xTool requires training and laser safety officer oversight and prohibits use in public or around untrained people or children.' ],
